      "problem": "The bottom-layer restriction can be bypassed with an ordinary relative import. A module in backend/system containing `from .. import library` passes this checker, although system is explicitly forbidden from importing another feature. The same branch also lets `from .. import features` bypass the restriction on importing the feature registry.",
